  "Name": "Lattice Semiconductor PAC-Designer 6.21 Symbol Value Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability found in Lattice Semiconductor PAC-Designer 6.21. As a .pac file, when supplying a long string of data to the 'value' field under the 'SymbolicSchematicData' tag, it is possible to cause a memory corruption on the stack, which results in arbitrary code execution under the context of the user.",
